---
// Guide Program Section
---

<section id="guide-program" class="guide-program section">
  <div class="container">
    <h2>Become one of the first FollowBirds guides in Algarve.</h2>
    <p class="section-subtitle">
      Join the early guide program and help shape the tools guides will use to run tours, share observations and create professional reports for clients.
    </p>

    <div class="program-grid">
      <div class="benefit-card">
        <div class="benefit-icon">🎨</div>
        <h3>Help shape guide tools</h3>
        <p>Your feedback directly influences the features we build. Be part of creating tools for professional guides.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="benefit-card">
        <div class="benefit-icon">⭐</div>
        <h3>Get listed early</h3>
        <p>Early guides will be featured in the FollowBirds directory and get priority support.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="benefit-card">
        <div class="benefit-icon">📄</div>
        <h3>Use reports with clients</h3>
        <p>Start using FollowBirds reports with your tours immediately and impress your clients.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="benefit-card">
        <div class="benefit-icon">📋</div>
        <h3>Prepare for future features</h3>
        <p>Get ready for tour templates, shared checklists and advanced guide analytics.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="program-cta">
      <p class="cta-text">Ready to join the guide program?</p>
      <!-- TODO: Add final contact form or email link -->
      <a href="mailto:guides@followbirds.com" class="btn btn-primary">Join the Guide Program</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .guide-program {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #2F7D32 0%, #1b5e20 100%);
    color: #fff;
  }

  .guide-program h2 {
    text-align: center;
    color: #fff;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .section-subtitle {
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9);
    margin-bottom: 3.5rem;
    max-width: 650px;
    margin-left: auto;
    margin-right: auto;
  }

  .program-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(270px, 1fr));
    gap: 2rem;
    margin-bottom: 3.5rem;
  }

  .benefit-card {
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
    padding: 2.25rem;
    border-radius: 0.85rem;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.18);
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
  }

  .benefit-card:hover {
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.18);
    border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3);
  }

  .benefit-icon {
    font-size: 2.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    display: block;
  }

  .benefit-card h3 {
    color: #fff;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .benefit-card p {
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
  }

  .program-cta {
    text-align: center;
  }

  .cta-text {
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85);
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
  }

  .program-cta .btn {
    background-color: #fff;
    color: #2F7D32;
  }

  .program-cta .btn:hover {
    background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9);
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .program-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
